  "term": "sl",
  "definition": "SL refers to Synchronization Likelihood, an EEG-derived measure summarized as SL values. In this study, SL values were calculated across frequency bands and used to derive graph-based features for classifying sporadic Creutzfeldt-Jakob disease, Alzheimer’s disease, and healthy older adults.",
